=== Mini interpreter FFI calls ===
  python.abs(-42) = 42
  python.max(3, 7) = 7
  libc.strlen('hello world') = 11
  sqrt(9.0) = 3.0

=== FFI in language syntax (hypothetical) ===
  Your language could expose FFI as a built-in statement:
  ffi load 'libc.so.6' as libc;
  let n = ffi call libc.strlen(str: 'hello');
  print n;   # 5
